{
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "editable": true,
 "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "links": [],
 "panels": [
  {
   "title": "What this dashboard proves, and what it cannot",
   "type": "text",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "These are ESO's own metrics: whether the sync pipeline from Vault to the Kubernetes Secret is **healthy**, and how hard it is working. A rotation that succeeds looks like nothing here \u2014 ESO reconciles on its 15s interval whether the value changed or not \u2014 so what you are watching for is the **failure** shape: sync errors climbing, or Ready dropping to 0.\n\nThe last hop, Secret \u2192 kubelet \u2192 the file inside the container, is not instrumented by anything on this page. Watch it directly: `kubectl -n $namespace logs -l app=secret-consumer -f`."
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Sync calls, and the ones that failed ($app-secret)",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 9,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "ESO reconciles every 15s regardless of whether the value changed, so the total rate is flat through a healthy rotation. The failure series is the one that matters: it goes non-zero when Vault is unreachable, the token is wrong, or the key does not exist.",
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(rate(externalsecret_sync_calls_total{name=\"$app-secret\"}[5m]))",
     "legendFormat": "sync calls"
    },
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "sum(rate(externalsecret_sync_calls_error{name=\"$app-secret\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "FAILED sync calls"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     },
     "unit": "reqps"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "ExternalSecret Ready ($app-secret)",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 9,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 5
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "1 while the Secret is in sync with Vault, 0 while it is not. It stays at 0 after a dev-mode Vault restart wipes the KV \u2014 and ESO's backoff means it can stay there for hours until something forces a reconcile.",
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "max(externalsecret_status_condition{name=\"$app-secret\",condition=\"Ready\",status=\"True\"})",
     "legendFormat": "Ready"
    },
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "max(externalsecret_status_condition{name=\"$app-secret\",condition=\"Ready\",status=\"False\"})",
     "legendFormat": "NOT Ready"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 20
     },
     "min": 0,
     "max": 1,
     "unit": "short"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Vault API calls made by ESO",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 14
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "Every call ESO makes to Vault, by outcome, across all ExternalSecrets \u2014 this metric carries no per-secret label. A rotation you perform with the vault CLI does not appear here; only ESO's own reads do.",
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(externalsecret_provider_api_calls_count[5m]))",
     "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     },
     "unit": "reqps"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "ExternalSecret reconcile duration",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 14
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "How long the last refresh took end to end. Part of the delay between rotating in Vault and the value appearing in the pod.",
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "max(externalsecret_reconcile_duration{name=\"$app-secret\"})",
     "legendFormat": "$app-secret"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     },
     "unit": "ns"
    }
   }
  }
 ],
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "tags": [
  "secrets",
  "external-secrets",
  "vault",
  "rotation"
 ],
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "name": "app",
    "label": "App",
    "type": "query",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "description": "The workload these panels show. Defaults to the app this scenario was activated for.",
    "query": {
     "query": "query_result(count by (app) ({{.WorkloadMetric}}_count) or label_replace(vector(1), \"app\", \"{{.WorkloadName}}\", \"\", \"\"))",
     "refId": "app",
     "qryType": 3
    },
    "definition": "query_result(count by (app) ({{.WorkloadMetric}}_count) or label_replace(vector(1), \"app\", \"{{.WorkloadName}}\", \"\", \"\"))",
    "regex": "/app=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
    "refresh": 1,
    "includeAll": false,
    "multi": false,
    "sort": 1,
    "current": {
     "selected": true,
     "text": "{{.WorkloadName}}",
     "value": "{{.WorkloadName}}"
    },
    "options": []
   },
   {
    "name": "namespace",
    "label": "Namespace",
    "type": "query",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "description": "Where the selected app runs.",
    "query": {
     "query": "label_values(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{deployment=\"$app\"}, namespace)",
     "refId": "namespace",
     "qryType": 1
    },
    "definition": "label_values(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{deployment=\"$app\"}, namespace)",
    "refresh": 1,
    "includeAll": false,
    "multi": false,
    "sort": 0,
    "current": {
     "selected": true,
     "text": "{{.WorkloadNamespace}}",
     "value": "{{.WorkloadNamespace}}"
    },
    "options": []
   }
  ]
 },
 "time": {
